cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PolyglotBugHunter-X in academic work, please cite it."
title: "PolyglotBugHunter-X: Multimodal AI Web Bug Hunter"
abstract: >-
  A multimodal agent for authorized web security testing that reads pages
  (text), inspects rendered output (image) and audits uploads (audio) in a
  single scan. Findings carry CVSS v3.1 base scores, evidence that can be
  re-checked, and CWE/OWASP mappings. Ships 43 non-destructive detection
  payloads across 8 bug classes, 24 of them polyglot.
type: software
